[[:db/retract 17592186120547 :question/answer-fields 17592186119395] {:db/id 17592186119874 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-4d57bf97-1629-5c5b-aa31-076c598fe8ff" "question-2e512d90-51a0-5df7-a85a-866294c50b88" "question-005f69e9-1456-54e0-a1fd-e854c7360e54" "question-f1c17071-3f38-5e15-9f1d-979ec9d512e0"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186119875 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-51f6ebb7-f4d6-54f8-92af-8a0f13b34712"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186119870 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3010fec5-ce32-5d13-98b7-fb9085f51f6f" "question-a480ef82-6feb-5a68-8ebb-ae39b1e1fdd6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186119687 :question/problem "Calculate the value of \n![](images/1f/1fd9cafe0db4412b48885cebacd68b9866a79fadfdb7767c3b63f8469d31bfea.svg)\n\n*Hint: Use elementary column operations to make the entries to the right of $a_{31}$ equal to zero. You should be able to reduce the given $4 \\times 4$ determinant to a $3 \\times 3$ determinant.*" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-4d57bf97-1629-5c5b-aa31-076c598fe8ff" :question/id #uuid "4d57bf97-1629-5c5b-aa31-076c598fe8ff" :question/math-academy-id "q-131255" :question/problem "$$\n|\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & -11 & -5 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 4 & -1 & 5 \\\\ -3 & -2 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|\n$$\n\nConsider the above $4\\times 4$ determinant. Which of the following $3\\times 3$ determinants has the same value?\n\n*Hint: Use elementary row operations to make the entries above and below ${a}_{22}$ equal to zero.*" :question/worked-solution "Let's make entries above and below ${a}_{22}=2$ equal to zero using elementary row operations.\n\nSince adding a multiple of one row (or column) to another row (column) in a matrix does not change the value of its determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & -11 & -5 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 4 & -1 & 5 \\\\ -3 & -2 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}| &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+3{R}_{2} \\\\ {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\ {R}_{4}:={R}_{4}+{R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 0 & 4 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -11 & -3 \\\\ -6 & 0 & 6 & 2\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the result along the $2$nd column, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 0 & 4 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -11 & -3 \\\\ -6 & 0 & 6 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-1)^{2+2}|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 8 & -11 & -3 \\\\ -6 & 6 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 8 & -11 & -3 \\\\ -6 & 6 & 2\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6fccaa80-3817-5c7f-a05e-83fa6ed0c12d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6fccaa80-3817-5c7f-a05e-83fa6ed0c12d" :answer-field/id #uuid "6fccaa80-3817-5c7f-a05e-83fa6ed0c12d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-fb266362-88fb-55ee-b32a-0a37bb635c10" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ffc76282-8435-5ff8-9828-1f03763d49b5" "answer-8677367f-731e-5786-810b-4a5834eb9e63" "answer-fb266362-88fb-55ee-b32a-0a37bb635c10" "answer-476634a7-3127-5dfb-8548-86988b800729" "answer-c5998369-5efd-53c2-a6dc-3f4d2c8c17c9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ffc76282-8435-5ff8-9828-1f03763d49b5" :answer/id #uuid "ffc76282-8435-5ff8-9828-1f03763d49b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 8 & -10 & -3 \\\\ -6 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8677367f-731e-5786-810b-4a5834eb9e63" :answer/id #uuid "8677367f-731e-5786-810b-4a5834eb9e63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 8 & -11 & -8 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fb266362-88fb-55ee-b32a-0a37bb635c10" :answer/id #uuid "fb266362-88fb-55ee-b32a